  forwardTo / destination:
    endpointType = "ServiceBusTopic"
    resourceId   = .../namespaces/prdct11935bus/topics/byoc-events
  -> the subscription delivers into the byoc-events TOPIC (not straight to a queue), which is the
     shape the module authors: the topic's SQL-filter subscriptions do the per-lane fan-out.
     ("forwardTo" is a Service Bus subscription property, not an Event Grid one; the Event Grid
      equivalent is destination.resourceId, printed above. The Service Bus `forwardTo` for the
      scanner lane is in at9-02 §2 / at9-03 §2: "endpoint-asset-ingestion-prdct11935".)

  advancedFilters is null — the live subscription publishes ALL BlobCreated events onto the topic.
  That matches the module default: subject_contains is empty unless a caller narrows it
  (cell-azure-instance/event_grid.tf:37 `subject_contains = var.ingestion_event_grid_subject_contains`).

